{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/151","id":4734640343,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTEdTLM8AAAABGjTg1w","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/151","diff_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/151.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/151.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/151","number":151,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Online: prove frozen-coefficient step-size minimization","user":{"login":"jicheng9617","id":74550583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTUwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74550583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617","html_url":"https://github.com/jicheng9617","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Proves the unnumbered scalar step-size calculation in Orabona arXiv:1912.13213v10, printed page 15 / PDF page 27. For positive fixed coefficients A,B, the public theorem produces the positive optimizer, attained value and universal minimum of A/(2η)+ηB/2; equality characterizes the unique optimizer. Distance/energy and exogenous D/G/T adapters share the same proof chain.\n\nThe reader preserves the source warning that actual gradient energy depends on η. A genuine same-loss projected OGD canary derives energy 1+(η−1)² and distinguishes η=1 from η=2. This package minimizes the coarse scalar bound; the existing sharp OGD theorem retains its negative terminal-distance term. It supplies no future-informed learner, across-rerun regret optimum or Chapter 5 lower bound. Zero coefficients and T=0 have explicit tested boundaries. The eleven proofs include library refinements, not eleven separately printed source theorems.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Public focused build, 23 nondegenerate/boundary canaries, root (9085 jobs), combined Tests (9224 jobs), and full harness (466 tests, 7 existing skips) passed locally.\n- All 41 named public/Test axiom records use only standard axioms. Eleven required native proof-value dependency pairs passed; all 13 public declarations have unique nodes and matching actual statement fingerprints in the shared registry.\n- Distinct automated blind decoder and source reviewer accepted the frozen contract, bodies, additive T=0 canary and final reader with explicit deltas. No human/external review is claimed. Immutable audit rehashed 1194 raw bindings.\n- Applicable contributor gate covers all 8 changed production paths. Clean site snapshot at 38236eeac865d1b14ee5e38eb7059ccd11842a33, site/registry checks and actual first-viewport review passed. Generated website/_site was untouched; no deployment.\n- Full git diff --check fails only on preserved raw compiler .log whitespace. The scoped check excludes only this task .log outputs and checks every other path. Draft/API/cache/frontier-interface/site-schema failures and exact prior Test snapshot are retained.\n\nEvidence: [acceptance decision](https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/346254f9f5a9b7921a64480cb427131cd27404a7/runs/online-optimal-step-20261004/accepted-decision.json), [binding audit](https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/346254f9f5a9b7921a64480cb427131cd27404a7/runs/online-optimal-step-20261004/accepted-binding-audit.json), [source-reader review](https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/346254f9f5a9b7921a64480cb427131cd27404a7/runs/online-optimal-step-20261004/final-reader-review.md).\n\nStacked on OPEN draft #150, exact base 8662832e8f8fbcb6df03f0c183c32c5a8ba50764; this diff is the scalar package only. Chapter 2 unit scaling, older production migration and the full chapter gate remain required. Chapters 3–16 and the whole-book Goal remain incomplete/active. This is compiled-local and reviewable, not merged or live.\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T13:14:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T13:18:35Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"952ff5b746ba5a10a26608a3b5ac9c2d03e621b6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/151/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/151/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/151/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/statuses/c4eb0fcea94e242bc93264e6d9ba3ef7d2c4acce","head":{"label":"DakeBU:codex/research-online-optimal-step","ref":"codex/research-online-optimal-step","sha":"c4eb0fcea94e242bc93264e6d9ba3ef7d2c4acce","user":{"login":"DakeBU","id":159223240,"node_id":"U_kgDOCX2NyA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159223240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/gists{/gist_id}","st